                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Can't you beat your friends in table tennis or air hockey? Fear no more, Redshift Blueshift is here to give you the equality!  Now you can use some tricks and a shiny screen to beat them easily. (Uhm.. maybe they can still beat you since they are good at reading your moves.) \n \nPros:\n+10/10 Balance\n+Suitable for e-sports ( The game has no online multiplayer, though.)\n+No pre-defined skill level at multiplayer. It can be super hardcore or super casual depending on you and your friend.\n+Catchy audio\n\nCons:\n-Sometimes AI feels like unbeatable at singleplayer. It can annoy casual players.",
